# Shivering Isles. SE05 "The Lady of Paranoia" (the Dementia half: Syl, Duchess of Dementia, Crucible). SE04Shell 10 set
# SE05 10 and the player stands in Sheogorath's palace in New Sheoth (the 0300 file's hand-off).
#
# Path taken: the torture route to the end, with the stage-60 night eavesdrop and Ma'zaddha's dead-man's evidence.
#   10 Syl -> 20 Herdir -> 30 (Herdir follows) -> Kithlan tortured twice = 40 -> Anya tortured once = 50 -> Ma'zaddha
#   tortured once = 55 -> Caldana Monrius tortured once = 60 -> night eavesdrop on Ma'zaddha and Nelrene = 70 -> confront
#   Ma'zaddha = 80 -> a day later his body (92), his key (95), the cupboard's sword (100) -> Nelrene = 110 -> Muurine = 120
#   -> Syl = 130 -> the chamber, Muurine's death and Syl's thanks = 200.
# Not drafted: Kithlan's audience hint (15; Syl is talked to directly, her greeting at SE05 < 20 allows it), the
# no-torture answers (disposition 80 with Kithlan 00080D40), the other informants (Anya's second answer, Cutter, Bernice,
# Bhisha, Ushnar), the failed eavesdrop (65) and Nelrene's "I heard you" route (90). SE05 45 is set by nothing.
# Torture (SE05HerdirTortureSpellScript): each torture choice ("Liar. Herdir, torture him!", "Liar! Herdir, torture her."
# by the target's sex; INFO 000805A7 / 0007FF45, a goodbye) is offered only while SEHerdirRef.FollowPlayer == 1 (the
# SE05HerdirFollowPlayer package's own gate) and the target is within 3000 of Herdir. The result sets Herdir's
# TargetRef and CastSpell; he casts, the target is held in place, and when the spell ends the TARGET force-greets the
# player (topic SE05PostTortureGreet). So a torture and its follow-up greeting are one case's steps, never split.
# DRAFT 2026-11-17: not run yet.

# Syl, at SE05 < 20: "Why do you approach the Duchess of Dementia? Do you seek death?" (INFO 00043E22) offers "I was told
# to find you." (INFO 0007FE20) -> "Who's spying on you?" (INFO 000139B3) -> "How can I help?" (INFO 0001361F, a goodbye;
# result Stage20Update 1; SESylScript, a GameMode poll, sets 20 and adds the topic Conspiracy). The travel is the
# player's: moveto.
case se05_syl
run
player.moveto SESylRef
wait 120
approach SESylRef
talk SESylRef
ask "I was told to find you."
ask "Who's spying on you?"
ask "How can I help?"
until 600 GetStage SE05 >= 20
bye if open
end

# Herdir at the torture chamber (SE05 20): "What brings you to this delightful corner of the House of Dementia?" (INFO
# 000805E8) offers "You're supposed to come with me." (INFO 000805EA) -> "Fine. Let's go." (INFO 000805ED, a goodbye):
# result SE05 30 and SEHerdirRef.FollowPlayer 1.
case se05_herdir
run
player.moveto SEHerdirRef
wait 120
approach SEHerdirRef
talk SEHerdirRef
ask "You're supposed to come with me."
ask "Fine. Let's go."
until 600 GetStage SE05 >= 30
until 300 SEHerdirRef.FollowPlayer == 1
bye if open
end

# Kithlan (SE05 30, topic "Conspiracy" from SE05 20): "No conspiracies here. Go pester someone else." (INFO 00080D41:
# Herdir within 3000, KithlanTorture < 2, disposition < 80) offers the torture choices. The first torture ends in
# Kithlan's force-greet "I swear, I know nothing about a conspiracy!" (INFO 00080D43, KithlanTorture 1, offers the
# choices again); the second in "All right, all right... please, just stop." (INFO 00080D42: KithlanTorture >= 2,
# result SE05 40). Herdir follows the player (a short moveto leaves him behind, so the case waits for him).
case se05_kithlan
run
player.moveto SEKithlanRef
until 3600 SEHerdirRef.GetDistance SEKithlanRef < 1500
approach SEKithlanRef
talk SEKithlanRef
ask "Conspiracy"
ask "Liar. Herdir, torture him!"
hear 3600 SEKithlanRef know nothing about a conspiracy
ask "Liar. Herdir, torture him!"
hear 3600 SEKithlanRef just stop
until 300 GetStage SE05 >= 40
bye if open
end

# Anya Herrick (SE05 40): "What? N...No. I don't know anything about anything." (INFO 00080D3D: AnyaTorture == 0,
# Herdir within 3000) offers the choices. One torture ends in her force-greet "Please. I am not involved..." (INFO
# 00080D79, AnyaTorture >= 1), which offers "What are you talking about?" (INFO 00080D7A): SE05 50.
case se05_anya
run
player.moveto SEAnyaHerrickRef
until 3600 SEHerdirRef.GetDistance SEAnyaHerrickRef < 1500
approach SEAnyaHerrickRef
talk SEAnyaHerrickRef
ask "Conspiracy"
ask "Liar! Herdir, torture her."
hear 3600 SEAnyaHerrickRef I am not involved
ask "What are you talking about?"
until 300 GetStage SE05 >= 50
bye if open
end

# Ma'zaddha at home (SE05 50): "I'm afraid I have no idea what you're talking about." (INFO 0008117E: stage 50,
# MazaddhaTorture == 0, Herdir within 3000) offers the choices. His force-greet "You may continue to do your worst,
# Inquisitor, ..." (INFO 000811CA, stages 50 .. 69) sets 55 and keeps MazaddhaTorture at 1 (needed at 70).
case se05_mazaddha_torture
run
player.moveto SEMazaddhaRef
until 3600 SEHerdirRef.GetDistance SEMazaddhaRef < 1500
approach SEMazaddhaRef
talk SEMazaddhaRef
ask "Conspiracy"
ask "Liar. Herdir, torture him!"
hear 3600 SEMazaddhaRef do your worst
until 300 GetStage SE05 >= 55
bye if open
end

# SE05 55: Herdir clears the Nelrene/Muurine/Cutter/Bernice counts. Caldana Monrius (SECaldanaMonriusRef, her house): "Nothin'
# in it for me, so I've nothin' to say to you." (INFO 0008ADED: stage 55, Herdir within 3000) offers the choices; her
# force-greet "All right, all right!" (INFO 00089616, a goodbye, one torture) sets 60.
case se05_caldana
run
player.moveto SECaldanaMonriusRef
until 3600 SEHerdirRef.GetDistance SECaldanaMonriusRef < 1500
approach SECaldanaMonriusRef
talk SECaldanaMonriusRef
ask "Conspiracy"
ask "Liar! Herdir, torture her."
hear 3600 SECaldanaMonriusRef All right, all right
until 300 GetStage SE05 >= 60
bye if open
end

# SE05 60: Ma'zaddha (SE05MazaddhaWaitforConversation, 0:00-4:00) and Nelrene (SE05NelreneWaitforMazaddha, 23:00-4:00) meet
# at SE05MazaddhaConvMarker / SE05NelreneMarker (Crucible, 42590 13630 1440; 42708 13607). SE05QuestScript sets
# Ma'zaddha's AtMarker within 200 and sends Nelrene (EVP); with the player within 1000 and unseen, SEMazaddhaSCRIPT has Nelrene
# StartConversation SE05Eavesdrop every 5 s (SE05Conv 1, 3, 5); the last line (INFO 00081179, "Good. I shall expect a
# progress report soon...") sets 70. Seen (detection >= 3) it is INFO 00081183 / 00089441 "Shh! Someone is nearby!" and
# 65 instead. The player stands at the SEDemDoor02 beside the plaza (000451EA, 43560 13658, about 980 from Ma'zaddha).
case se05_eavesdrop
run
set gamehour to 23.5
until 7200 SEMazaddhaRef.GetDistance SE05MazaddhaConvMarker < 200
until 3600 SENelreneRef.GetDistance SE05NelreneMarker < 100
run
player.moveto 000451EA
until 3600 GetStage SE05 >= 70 || GetStage SE05 == 65
expect GetStage SE05 >= 70
end

# SE05 70: Ma'zaddha, still at the marker, answers "Conspiracy" with "I've told you, I don't know anything. You can't
# prove a thing!" (INFO 00080D7C: stage >= 70, MazaddhaTorture >= 1, 80 not done) offering "I heard you talking to
# Nelrene." (INFO 00080D7C's choice, topic SE05MazaddhaSawYou, INFO 00081186: "What?") -> "Who else is involved?" (INFO
# 00081188) -> "Very well. Bring me names." (INFO 0008118A) = 80; "Meet me in my house tomorrow at midnight."
case se05_mazaddha_confront
wait 300
approach SEMazaddhaRef
talk SEMazaddhaRef
ask "Conspiracy"
ask "I heard you talking to Nelrene."
ask "Who else is involved?"
ask "Very well. Bring me names."
until 300 GetStage SE05 >= 80
bye if open
end

# SE05 80: once Ma'zaddha is indoors with the player in another cell (SEMazaddhaSCRIPT) he is disabled
# (SE05.MazaddhaClear 1, DayCheck = the day count) and SE05QuestScript enables his body (SEMazaddhaDeadRef) while the player is
# out of his house. When the day count passes DayCheck (SE05.MazaddhaDead 1) it unlocks his door (SEMazaddhaDoorRef).
# The player is away and lets the night pass: `set gamehour` stands in for waiting, as in mq05_shrine_clue.
case se05_mazaddha_home
run
set gamehour to 5
until 7200 SE05.MazaddhaClear == 1
run
set gamehour to 23.9
wait 300
until 3600 SE05.MazaddhaDead == 1
until 600 SEMazaddhaDeadRef.GetDisabled == 0
end

# The body (SEMazaddhaDeadScript): within 200 of it sets 92. Taking the key from it (SE05Key; SE05QuestScript polls the
# inventory) sets 95 and SE05MazaddhaCupboardRef's ownership; the cupboard (upstairs, SENSMazaddhasHouseUpstairs) holds
# the evidence, and SE05Shortsword in the inventory sets 100. The player enters at the house door
# (SEMazaddhaDoorRef, inside the house); RemoveAllItems stands in for looting.
case se05_evidence
run
player.moveto SEMazaddhaDoorRef
wait 60
approach SEMazaddhaDeadRef
until 600 GetStage SE05 >= 92
run
SEMazaddhaDeadRef.RemoveAllItems player
until 300 player.GetItemCount SE05Key >= 1
until 300 GetStage SE05 >= 95
run
player.moveto SE05MazaddhaCupboardRef
wait 60
run
SE05MazaddhaCupboardRef.RemoveAllItems player
until 300 player.GetItemCount SE05Shortsword >= 1
until 300 GetStage SE05 >= 100
end

# Nelrene (SE05 100, 110 not done): "You have no proof! You cannot hold me accountable for anything!" (INFO 000811C8:
# Nelrene, stage >= 90, 100 done) offers "I have your ceremonial sword." (INFO 0008199F, SE05 110).
case se05_nelrene
run
player.moveto SENelreneRef
wait 120
approach SENelreneRef
talk SENelreneRef
ask "Conspiracy"
ask "I have your ceremonial sword."
until 300 GetStage SE05 >= 110
bye if open
end

# Muurine (SE05 110): "I see you've done quite a bit of work to track me down." (INFO 00081368: 100 and 110 done, 120 not;
# "Conspiracy"), a confession whose result sets 120 and SEHerdirRef.FollowPlayer 3.
case se05_muurine
run
player.moveto SEMuurineRef
wait 120
approach SEMuurineRef
talk SEMuurineRef
ask "Conspiracy"
until 300 GetStage SE05 >= 120
bye if open
end

# Syl (SE05 120): "What news do you have to report, Inquisitor?" (INFO 00081369) offers "Muurine was behind it." (INFO
# 0008136A, a goodbye): SE05 130, Muurine is moved to SE05MuurineCageMarker, the chamber gate is locked, and Syl walks
# to SE05SylChamberMarker (package SE05SyltoChamber).
case se05_report
run
player.moveto SESylRef
wait 120
approach SESylRef
talk SESylRef
ask "Muurine was behind it."
until 300 GetStage SE05 >= 130
bye if open
end

# The chamber (House of Dementia, 660 -3072 -1200). When Syl is within 300 of SE05SylChamberMarker her script has her say
# SE05SylEndSpeech to Muurine, then (Speech 3) she pushes the switch (SE05SylPushSwitch; SE05ButtonScript, Speech 4) and
# three SE05ShockSpell casts kill Muurine; 3 s after her death SESylScript has Syl StartConversation the player: "You see
# now what happens when those who oppose me fail ..." (INFO 00081792, stage 130, Muurine dead), which sets 200 (the
# SE05Bow, SE05TrophyRef, Nelrene disabled, SEObelisks 50; SE06 5 only if SE04 is 200). The player arrives with Syl (she
# only walks to the marker; the player stands by her) and takes no part in the kill.
case se05_chamber
until 7200 SESylRef.GetDistance SE05SylChamberMarker < 300
run
player.moveto SESylRef
until 3600 SEMuurineRef.GetDead == 1
until 3600 GetStage SE05 >= 200
until 300 player.GetItemCount SE05Bow >= 1
bye if open
end
